mission "The Notary of Crown's Fall"
    name "The Notary of Crown's Fall"
    description "Sail to Crown's Fall and collect the original charter from Notary Bell."
    source "Nueva Esperanza"
    destination "Crown's Fall"
    reward 710
    speaker offer "Harbourmaster"
    speaker visit "Harbourmaster"
    speaker complete "Harbourmaster"
    to offer
        has "A Letter in the Main: done"
    on offer
        conversation
            `The former notary at Crown's Fall holds the original charter that gave the Meridian Company its supposed authority.`
            `He hid the document in a church archive after discovering that the royal seal on it was copied.`
            `The Company knows he kept a copy and has offered a reward for his arrest. He will only show the evidence to a captain who arrives without a Company flag.`
            choice
                `(I will take this voyage. Tell me the course.)`
                    goto accept_job
                `(What makes this business so important?)`
                    goto more_details
                `(I have other waters to sail.)`
                    goto decline_job
            label more_details
                `The Company knows he kept a copy and has offered a reward for his arrest. He will only show the evidence to a captain who arrives without a Company flag.`
                choice
                    `(Then I will see it done.)`
                        goto accept_job
                    `(Not this time.)`
                        goto decline_job
            label accept_job
                `Judge Valera supplies a plain merchant pennant. “Let them think you are carrying salt. The truth will make enough noise when it is read aloud.”`
                accept
            label decline_job
                `The officer nods and rolls the chart closed. The offer will remain here if you change your mind.`
                close
    on accept
        log "Accepted The Notary of Crown's Fall. Sail to Crown's Fall and collect the original charter from Notary Bell."
    on visit
        conversation
            `Bell produces the charter and a list of paid officials. The list includes the governor of Sugarhook, who has been supplying forced labour to the Company yards.`
    on complete
        conversation
            `The next lead points to the plantations and cane wharves at Sugarhook.`
        log "Completed The Notary of Crown's Fall. Received 710 gold. The next lead points to the plantations and cane wharves at Sugarhook."
